{# proposal integration report section (spec proposal §14.2).

Renders notifiable proposals grouped by kind, sorted by number within kind.
- H2 per kind: kind name (linked to tracker repo if tracker_url given)
- H3 per proposal: 4-level title fallback
- Small badge with number / status transition / file name
- AI summary (or fallback text)
- Detail block ALWAYS rendered (with fallback text if detail empty)
- `---` separator between reports within a kind and between kinds

Footer is emitted once by the aggregator (``aggregated_report.j2``), not per
section, to avoid repeating it for every kind.
#}
## [{% if tracker_url %}{{ kind | upper }}]({{ tracker_url }}){% else %}{{ kind | upper }}{% endif %}

{% for report in reports %}
{% if report.title and report.file_url %}
### [{{ report.title }}]({{ report.file_url }})
{% elif report.title %}
### {{ report.title }}
{% elif report.file_url %}
### [#{{ report.number }} {{ report.file_path | basename }}]({{ report.file_url }})
{% else %}
### #{{ report.number }} {{ report.file_path | basename }}
{% endif %}
<small>#️⃣ #{{ report.number }} · 📌 {% if report.old_status %}{{ report.old_status }} → {{ report.new_status }}{% else %}{{ report.new_status }} ({{ _("new") }}){% endif %} · 📄 {{ report.file_path | basename }}</small>

{{ report.analysis_summary or _("No summary available.") }}

<details>
<summary>{{ _("Click to view detailed analysis") }}</summary>

{{ report.analysis_detail or _("No detailed analysis available.") }}

</details>
{% if not loop.last %}

---

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
